  "description": "The host-agnostic part of OmniEurope.Diagnostics, without the ASP.NET Core shared framework: the in-process performance recorder (requests heard from the ASP.NET Core metrics when there are any, operations the host records itself or publishes on its own histograms), an embeddable unstyled Blazor view of its figures, a file logger writing compact Serilog JSON without depending on Serilog, and the services that read, filter and watch the logs. Usable in a Blazor Hybrid application.",
